// Page Intro Text :
"P178599633" "You think you've beaten me?"
// Answer Text :
"P1001880418" "Yep. Kicked your butt."
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P1244310975" "What will I do now? Being evil is all I know how to do."
// Answer Text :
