"P1550940736" "Umm."
// Answer Text :
"P2141117208" "Leave."
// Page InformationPage2 Text :
"P1645734116" "Or we could mutate the disease at the cellular level and enlarge it until it's the size of a house!That's the only way we will learn more about it! Perhaps let it feed and determine how it replicates."
// Answer Text :
"P1818029903" "You're hopeless, Kane."
