// Page Intro1 Text :
"P1043435923" "Honestly, have you ever seen such a crappy haunted house?"
// Answer Text :
"P1977862876" "I think this place might actually be haunted."
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P1893033877" "Canned screams, fake zombies. I saw some guy down the hall tearing fake guts out of someone. I watch all of those ghost shows on television and let me tell you something - haunted this place isn't."
// Answer Text :
"P735657556" "Have you heard about the missing visitors?"
// Answer Text :
"P2420087866" "Goodbye."
// Page InformationPage4 Text :
"P4127063035" "They probably ran away because it's SO FAKE. I mean I want to be scared to death!"
// Answer Text :
"P551566629" "Be careful what you wish for."
// Answer Text :
// Page InformationPage2 Text :
"P2427427539" "Right! What are they going to do? Murder me horribly?"
// Answer Text :
"P4211300521" "Wow, I hope not."
// DisplayName for M_NPC1 :
"P3586926128" "Rutha Salk"

