// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// Script Variable Greeting :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Undertaker 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro1 Text :
"P3306016624" "Fine night for a haunted house, don't you agree?"
// Answer Text :
"P3695271874" "What's happening inside?"
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P3226712738" "Well I suppose it could be alarming to have so many young people vanish on one night. Perhaps they've lost their way. I suggest you enter and look for them."
// Answer Text :
"P2817404675" "What do you mean?"
// Answer Text :
"P3701419339" "I'm done talking to you."
// Page InformationPage4 Text :
"P793647003" "If the rumors are true and people are going missing inside this house, then I think someone like you should be trying to find them. A little adventure never hurt anyone, yes?"
// Answer Text :
"P3374126331" "What do I have to do?"
// Answer Text :
// Page InformationPage2 Text :
"P2083406145" "Just step inside and enjoy Dr. Kane's home. It's a bright and cheery place if I do say so myself. Oh, and try not leave stains on the carpet, hmm?"
// DisplayName for M_NPC1 :
"P2510579154" "Mr. Morturary"

