// Script Variable BOSS_1STBLOOD_DIALOG :
"P2335924895" "<t=4 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=4><scale 3><color DarkOrange><bgcolor Black>A simple Halloween tradition - a visit to a haunted house.<t=6 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=6><scale 3><color DarkOrange><bgcolor Black>This year, Dr. Kane, a retired scientist and noted recluse, has dared thrillseekers to venture into his dark and mysterious mansion.<t=4 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=5><scale 3><color DarkOrange><bgcolor Black>But things are not as they seem in Dr. Kane's house of horror. <t=5 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=5><scale 3><color DarkOrange><bgcolor Black>Visitors are entering the mansion never to be heard from again....<t=3 caption x= 0.5 y=0.5 d=3><scale 10><color Crimson><bgcolor Black>A scream pierces the night!"
// Script Variable BOSS_1ST_DIALOG :
"P1406161672" "<t=7 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=7><scale 3><color DarkOrange><bgcolor Black>Thrillseekers line up for their turn to be terrified.<t=8 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=8><scale 3><color DarkOrange><bgcolor Black>But the smell of blood and a feeling of doom weight the stale air."
// Script Variable BOSS_2ND_DIALOG :
"P1428642863" "<t=4 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=4><scale 3><color DarkOrange><bgcolor Black>A shrieking voice cries:<t=6 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=6><scale 10><color Crimson><bgcolor Black><i>'What is wrong with the flesh? Is it that it clings to the backs of the living?<t=6 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=6><scale 10><color Crimson><bgcolor Black> All flesh must be taken! The abomination will become more than human!</i>'"
// Script Variable BOSS_4TH_DIALOG :
"P194156180" "<t=5 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=6><scale 3><color DarkOrange><bgcolor Black>The smell of decay and littered corpses betrays Dr. Kane's dark secret as a defiler of the dead. <t=5 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=6><scale 3><color DarkOrange><bgcolor Black>But to what end is this madman working?<t=5 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=6><scale 3><color DarkOrange><bgcolor Black>The shuffling of cold, dead feet heralds the walking dead and promises that more of Dr. Kane's horrors await you."
// Script Variable BOSS_5TH_DIALOG :

// ************************************************************************
// ************************************************************************
// ************************************************************************

// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Generated by transModule
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : data/scripts/SpawnDefs/ZoneEvents/Halloween2011Trial/_src/Halloween_11_trial.xls 	Sheet : ZE_Halloween_2011_Prelude_Cap2 
//
// Script      : Xlstospawndef.bat 
// Version     : 38 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// Script Variable BOSS_1STBLOOD_DIALOG :
"P957829730" "<t=5 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=6><scale 3><color Crimson><bgcolor Black><i>'You will make fine playthings for the abomination!</i><t=5 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=6><scale 3><color Crimson><bgcolor Black><i>But first, meet one of my most prized failures. I call him Experiment Number Nine!'</i>"
// Script Variable BOSS_1ST_DIALOG :
"P1444340842" "<t=5 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=6><scale 3><color DarkOrange><bgcolor Black>Dr. Kane shrieks with delight as you enter the graveyard.<t=5 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=6><scale 3><color Crimson><bgcolor Black><i>'Into the web stumbles the prey!</i><t=5 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=6><scale 3><color Crimson><bgcolor Black><i> Meet the next evolution of mankind! It's more than flesh and bone, it is hunger and pain!</i><t=5 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=6><scale 3><color Crimson><bgcolor Black><i> It is my greatest work, the abomination!</i>'"
// Script Variable BOSS_2ND_DIALOG :
"P3268895317" "<t=5 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=6><scale 3><color Crimson><bgcolor Black><i>'Rise, my pet!'</i>"
// Script Variable BOSS_3RD_DIALOG :

