// Script Variable Greeting :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - DevilGirl 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro1 Text :
"P2149572473" "The Black Whip will strike soon. You'll see."
// Answer Text :
"P2014010718" "What are you doing?"
// Page Intro2 Text :
"P3531117044" "Back so soon?"
// Answer Text :
"P3901815253" "What did you want me to do again?"
// Answer Text :
"P912394731" "Nevermind."
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P1896404953" "We are sisters of the darkness. We are the ones who will call forth the Black Whip. Would you care to aid us?"
// Answer Text :
"P2360752059" "Sure thing. What do I have to do?"
// Answer Text :
"P1463338402" "No thanks. You're creepy."
// Page InformationPage2 Text :
"P4170019137" "The Black Whip cannot enter this world without, hmmm, let's call it sustinance. We've placed harmless enchantments on some of the sweets around here. You can help us by convincing the flies to go to the honey if you get my meaning."
// Answer Text :
"P1845012228" "I'll keep my eyes open."
// Answer Text :
"P2477524047" "I'm not interested."
// Page InformationPage3 Text :
"P720498425" "So be it. Consider it a pact."
// Answer Text :
"P2878319632" "Yes, a pact."
// Page InformationPage4 Text :
"P1939601411" "Although I really dislike repeating myself, I will make an exception if you will promise to get on with our little pact. Seek out an innocent soul or two and convince them that what they really need to do right now is indulge in a few sweets. Got it?"
// Answer Text :
"P840247211" "All right, all right. Don't get testy."
// Page Fallback Text :
"P1690228981" "There seems to be something wrong. I can't put my finger on it."
// Answer Text :
"P3503919411" "I feel like there's a bug in the works."
// DisplayName for M_NPC1 :
"P1049092504" "Devil Girl"

